     "$x^2 + h^2$",
     "$x^2 + xh + h^2$",
     "$2x + 2h$"
    ],
    "answer": 0,
    "hint": "Write it as $(x + h)(x + h)$ and multiply all four pairs.",
    "explain": "$(x + h)(x + h) = x^2 + xh + hx + h^2$. The middle term $2xh$ is the one that goes missing."
   },
